      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 6</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE LOCAL HAS REGULAR MEMBERS THAT ARE ELIGIBLE TO VOTE.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 7A</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE LOCAL GOVERNING BODY IS ELECTED BY ITS MEMBERS</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 7B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE MEMBERS OF THE LOCAL HAVE THE RIGHT TO ATTEND MEMBERSHIP MEETINGS AND TO PARTICIPATE IN THE DELIBERATIONS AND VOTING UPON THE BUSINESS OF SUCH MEETINGS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 11B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE FORM 990 WILL BE REVIEWED BY THE PRESIDENT, CFO, TREASURER AND THE FINANCE COMMITTEE. THE FORM 990 IS FILED WITH THE IRS AFTER REVIEW OF THE FORM 990 IS COMPLETE. COPIES ARE ALSO PROVIDED TO LOCAL UNION MEMBERS UPON REQUEST.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 12C</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>SEIU ENFORCES ITS CONFLICT OF INTEREST POLICY BY REQUIRING BOARD MEMBERS AND OFFICERS TO SIGN DETAILED CONFLICT OF INTEREST STATEMENTS AT LEAST ANNUALLY.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION C, LINE 19</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE GOVERNING DOCUMENTS, FINANCIAL STATEMENTS AND CONFLICT OF INTEREST POLICY ARE AVAILABLE ON THE LOCAL'S WEBSITE AND PROVIDED TO THE PUBLIC UPON REQUEST.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 8B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>NO OTHER COMMITTEE HAS AUTHORITY TO ACT ON BEHALF OF THE GOVERNING BODY.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART XII, LINE 2C:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THERE WERE NO CHANGES TO THE OVERSIGHT PROCESS OR THE SELECTION PROCESS OF THE INDEPENDENT ACCOUNTANT DURING THE TAX YEAR.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
